msgstr "Gebreekte Lessenaar Lêer"

#: fileItem.js:347
msgid ""
"This .desktop file has errors or points to a program without permissions. It "
"can not be executed.\n"
"\n"
"\t<b>Edit the file to set the correct executable Program.</b>"
msgstr ""
"Hierdie .desktop lêer het foute of wys na 'n program sonder toestemmings. "
"Dit kan nie uitgevoer word nie.\n"
"\n"
"\t<b>Wysig die lêer om die korrekte uitvoerbare program te stel.</b>"

#: fileItem.js:353
msgid "Invalid Permissions on Desktop File"
msgstr "Ongeldige Toestemmings op Werkskerm Lêer"

#: fileItem.js:354
msgid ""
"This .desktop File has incorrect Permissions. Right Click to edit "
"Properties, then:\n"
msgstr ""
"Hierdie .desktop Lêer het verkeerde Toestemmings. Regs Kliek om Eienskappe "
"te wysig, dan:\n"

#: fileItem.js:356
msgid ""
"\n"
"<b>Set Permissions, in \"Others Access\", \"Read Only\" or \"None\"</b>"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<b>Stel Toestemmings, in \"Others Access\", \"Read Only\" of \"None\"</b>"

#: fileItem.js:359
msgid ""
"\n"
"<b>Enable option, \"Allow Executing File as a Program\"</b>"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"<b>In staat stel opsie, \"Allow Executing File as a Program\"</b>"

#: fileItem.js:367
msgid ""
"This .desktop file is not trusted, it can not be launched. To enable "
"launching, right-click, then:\n"
"\n"
"<b>Enable \"Allow Launching\"</b>"
msgstr ""
"Hierdie .desktop lêer word nie vertrou nie, dit kan nie geloods word nie. Om "
"bekendstelling te in staat stel, regskliek en dan:\n"
"\n"
"<b>In staat stel \"Allow Launching\"</b>"

